    "label": "48",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following algebraic fractions.\n$$\\frac{\\dfrac1x+\\dfrac1y}{\\dfrac1x-\\dfrac1y}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{x+y}{y-x}$, for real $x,y$ with $x\\ne0$, $y\\ne0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
      "worked": "Multiply top and bottom by $xy$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\frac1x+\\frac1y}{\\frac1x-\\frac1y}&=\\frac{y+x}{y-x}\\\\\\frac{\\frac1x+\\frac1y}{\\frac1x-\\frac1y}&=\\frac{x+y}{y-x}\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: real $x,y$ with $x\\ne0$, $y\\ne0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
